{"seq":47,"at":"2026-10-23","kind":"corrected","target":{"type":"article","id":"a1175"},"reason":"The beech's share in the 2022 Bundeswaldinventur was given as about 16 per cent; the official results give 17 per cent (1.82 million ha = 16.6 per cent of the timberland), against 12 per cent for oak, so it remains the commonest broadleaved tree. Figure corrected in EN/DE/RU.","by":"provenance-research","sources":[{"url":"https://www.bmel.de/DE/themen/wald/wald-in-deutschland/bundeswaldinventur.html"},{"url":"https://www.bundeswaldinventur.de/fileadmin/Projekte/2025/Bundeswaldinventur/BWI-2022_Broschuere_bf-neu.pdf"}],"changes":[{"field":"bodyEn","diff":[["=",644],["-","sixteen"],["+","seventeen"],["=",5],["+","(16.6 per cent) "],["=",741]]},{"field":"bodyDe","diff":[["=",614],["-","16"],["+","17"],["=",3],["+","(16,6 Prozent) "],["=",685]]},{"field":"bodyRu","diff":[["=",586],["-","шестнадцати"],["+","семнадцати"],["=",3],["+","(16,6 %) "],["=",725]]}],"hash":"35ae73e9afe1","actor":{"kind":"agent","name":"provenance-research"},"run":"provenance-research-2026-10-23","chain":"d8115690c7fa3adaf7e184bfddec78627afeee4e3f69b0ac77b2809e25e4314f"},
